# The entrance spirit (GatekeeperSpirit) of the Seven Signs dungeons: a member of the Dawn cabal, which owns the Seal of Avarice and wins, gets the Dawn page.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/gatekeeper_spirit_dawn.golden
character Pilgrim 40
cabal dawn avarice
festival 100 0
sealowner avarice dawn
script script.teleport.GatekeeperSpirit
page gatekeeper/31111.htm
page script/teleport/GatekeeperSpirit/
npc spirit 31111 DungeonGatekeeper 10 0 0

action spirit
action spirit
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=spirit item=0 page=script/teleport/GatekeeperSpirit/dawn.htm
  S ActionFailed
